WEBVTT

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:03.980
Huh?

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:07.060
The colors...

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:10.110
No, this can't be... But how...?

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:12.570
Hey, look there!

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:14.110
What is that?!

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:17.870
Hey, is this for real?!

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:23.910
No way...

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:26.420
Is this real?

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:27.960
What is it?

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:44.690
Wh-What is that?

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:51.190
This city is a gold mine.

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:54.570
Once my perfect golem is completed,

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:57.700
there won't be anyone to stand in my way.

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:01.370
I have infinite time and
no shortage of material to work with,

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:04.370
so I can experiment all I want.

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:08.540
Just a bit longer... Just a bit longer...

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:22.100
What is all this?
<i>This</i> is what you wanted to become?

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:24.020
That is correct.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:36.360
This is what my wish is.

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:39.030
This is the form of god that the Rosenthals,

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:43.330
who profane life and toy
with death, have been seeking!

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:44.160
Huh?

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:48.120
A being with a perfect soul and a perfect body.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:50.380
That is a god! That is me!

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:54.050
That's ridiculous. Go do that someplace else.

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:59.050
What do you mean, ridiculous?
You people have been seeking this, as well.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:04.640
Having someone who is not a god
achieving a celestial purpose--Level 6.

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:06.890
It's something very much like this.

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:09.310
I'm not the least bit interested.

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:12.730
Though there's no shortage of
scumbags doing research on it like crazy.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:19.030
I see. Well, in my case, that research
has been tremendously helpful.

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:23.240
After searching the whole world,
this is the only place

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:28.040
where I was could find the horror
of the memories of 10,031 deaths.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:35.590
Hey, what did you just say?

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:58.530
"A Certain Scientific Accelerator"

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:10.430
"#11 Perfect Golem (Perfect Body)"

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:10.310
The thing I was lacking that
kept me from becoming a god

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:16.610
was more than 10,000 dying memories.
That was the most important key.

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:19.980
Thank heaven for Academy City.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:24.910
Hmm? Oh, so you're the one.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:28.950
The person who created
those 10,031 dying memories.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:32.540
Well, I see, I see, so that's how this is.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:42.670
Did you know that each of the 10,031
dead girls' memories have you in them?

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:48.720
Meticulously recording how cruelly
and mercilessly you killed each girl.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:53.480
I'm impressed you managed to kill that many.
That's too much for even me!

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:59.480
I mean, to do something
as gruesome as killing 10,031 people!

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.690
You have my respect!

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:07.570
Screw you. You're using their
deaths for something like <i>this</i>?

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:16.500
Their memories belong to nobody else.
They're theirs alone.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:23.920
They're not something a monster
like you gets to use as you please!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:32.350
You're through!

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:48.450
Indeed. That's the power
that killed those 10,031, is it?

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.160
Tch.

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:56.620
But then, it won't work against me.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:09.800
No matter how many times you grow back,
I'll pulverize you until nothing's left.

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:19.060
You're desperate! Desperate, desperate!

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.860
But it won't do any good.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:30.030
I think it's about time I got going.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:34.330
It will take a little more time
for me to completely become a god.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:39.080
You and that dimwitted current
family head should leave now, while you can.

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:43.040
Tch.

00:06:56.270 --> 00:07:00.230
What is it that I've been doing?

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:02.600
If you hadn't come here as a necromancer,

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:06.480
this girl would not have committed suicide.

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:10.400
Lots of people have died? No.

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:16.160
You spread death wherever you went.
That's what a necromancer does.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:21.170
You were born a Rosenthal,
and you never picked up on that?

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:24.290
You want to protect others?

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:28.130
I will fulfill the wish of the Rosenthals.

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:32.720
And you, you failure to the family,
will sit there and watch me.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:39.560
I couldn't protect anything. I've lost Hirumi,

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:44.520
and all that remains is the fact that the
blame rests entirely with the Rosenthals.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:51.240
What am I? What have I done?
Why have I come here? Am I...

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:56.410
"The culmination of the hard work
that Misaka had to overcome...

00:07:56.410 --> 00:08:00.790
...such difficulty to finish making...
Delicious, isn't it?"

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:05.380
...says Misaka Misaka...

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:07.880
"It is at times like this

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:14.550
that I want you to have
happy dreams," wishes Misaka.

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:25.270
"If this is what the
Rosenthal family really wanted,

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:28.860
then is that truly the form
of god that they spoke of?"

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:31.650
asks Misaka, unable to stop trembling.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:35.860
No, it's not. This is just
a scum-bucket monster.

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:40.740
It's got squat to do with
the Rosenthals or anything else.

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:42.120
Adonai...

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.460
Hey!

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:46.420
What do you want to do?

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:49.250
It's your life. You choose.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:54.510
But if you're going to be a hero,
don't mistake what you want to save.

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:55.760
A hero?

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:58.760
A hero is someone who doesn't
hesitate to stretch out their hands

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:01.520
and run as fast as they can toward
what they're trying to save.

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:04.770
What do you want to save with your hands?

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:08.110
If you don't even know what
that is, you'll never reach it.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:09.690
I want...

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:16.280
If I ever need anything, you can do it for me!

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:19.200
When you say "do it," what does that mean?

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.450
Promise me, Esther!

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:22.410
Promise you?

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:23.790
Yep.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.330
A promise.

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:28.580
If it sounds like I'm messing around,
this is your wakeup call!

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:30.790
I will preserve Hirumi's life.

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:35.010
I will by no means be made
your toy and have my life taken!

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:43.100
Found it. What I want to save.
What I want to protect. I want...

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:45.520
Master, I have a favor to ask.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:46.730
Huh?

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:49.650
To defeat that devil who's
tampering with life and death--

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:52.270
to defeat that monster...

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:57.990
...I need you to help me.

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:59.700
Fine with me.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.330
Huotou, fight alongside me.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:05.580
Acknowledged, Adonai.

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:09.080
Let's kick that monster's ass.

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:10.920
Yeah.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:15.260
You stay here and make penance
for what you've done, or something.

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:22.550
It's changing its shape.

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:24.930
Actually, it seems to be
getting bigger, doesn't it?

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:27.520
And they still want us
to just shut up and watch?

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:29.730
We have to do something
before anything happens!

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:32.770
Wait! We still don't have clearance
from the governing board!

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:33.570
But...!

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.150
Take it easy, Yomikawa!

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:38.990
What good is charging that thing blindly
when we don't even know what it is?

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:42.320
Ito, send up the drone.
We can start by examining it.

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:42.990
Huh?

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:44.740
We may not be allowed to move in,

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.540
but they never said
we couldn't surveil it, did they?

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:48.960
All right!

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:01.890
Huh?

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:06.890
How did you get ahead of us?

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.060
You're a tough bastard.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:16.190
I have all kinds of exclusive
material supply routes in this school.

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:18.940
Besides, I can't die yet...

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:26.080
I won't let the guy who did that
to my Hirumi... get away with it...

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:29.660
"But can we really defeat that thing?"

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:35.380
asks Misaka, unconvinced that we can
gain victory over that monstrous foe.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:39.880
It's all right.
I have Emperor Shun's Blade here.

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:45.010
It's a dagger which carries magic
that can disrupt Taowu's pseudo-soul.

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:48.680
It's like a specific poison, just for Taowu.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:52.100
I just have to bring the blade
in contact with Taowu's charm.

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:58.360
It doesn't sound like it's going to be easy.

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:02.200
Now that her body is so grotesque,
it's going to be hard to detect the charm.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.110
Tch, what a pain.

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:07.030
If I blow the whole thing away,
we can do whatever we like, can't we?

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:08.910
Master, that won't work.

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:10.410
Huh?!

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:12.960
Even if you use your power
to blow her all away,

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:17.040
as long as the pseudo-soul charm is intact,
the body will regenerate.

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:21.420
Tch, I'm not sure I get it, but it sounds
like we have to beat it out of there.

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:25.050
Yes, that's what it means.
I knew you'd understand.

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:28.390
If that's the case,
then I can show you to Hirumi--

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:34.060
or rather, to where that monster is, mm-hmm...

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:41.570
Hishigata...

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:51.330
Show us the way?
To where that thing's main body is?

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:54.580
That thing is assimilating
the school right now...

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:59.040
If we use my supply routes,
we should be able to get close...

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:02.050
B-But if you move now, you'll...

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:07.140
That's okay... I'm going to die anyway...

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:14.350
Before I do, I have to get Hirumi...
my precious Hirumi back...

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:19.230
If you're going to do this,
you'd better hurry...

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:21.110
According to my research,

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:26.280
it won't take much time for a body
that size to swell up into its perfect form.

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:30.950
The old become-good-before-dying play, huh?
Trying to atone for your sins?

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:34.620
Heh-heh, I don't have
any feelings of guilt, even now...

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:38.040
Hirumi is mine... I won't let
even the devil have her...

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.590
B-But...

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:41.590
Doesn't really matter.

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:45.590
Even evil people have at least
one thing they won't budge on.

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:48.930
Heh-heh, that's what
I'm talking about, mm-hmm...

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:01.230
Ugh, it's disgusting.
It's moving around inside the walls.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:04.030
I don't know who or what is doing this,

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:06.570
but what reason could they possibly have?

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:39.230
"It looks like this has gotten even bigger,"

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:42.770
says Misaka, anxiously looking around her.

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:44.110
You scared?

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:46.650
"E-Everything is all right," responds Misaka,

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:49.990
though worrying that she is
not entirely concealing her anxiety.

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:52.870
This is a battle between villains.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:56.660
Since you're not a villain,
you can hang back and keep quiet.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.080
Huh?

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:27.070
Tch, just strolling around inside me, huh?
And here I am still evolving, too.

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:30.530
The current family head is
too polite to tell them to wait

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:34.120
and is going to end up
interfering with her own ancestor.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:38.750
What a pain. My offspring
really are good for nothing.

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:44.380
"Is something the matter?" inquires Misaka.

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:47.250
It was nothing.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:49.590
Intuitive little bastard.

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:53.220
Aw, what a pain! What a total pain!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:56.010
Damn it, why is this happening?!

00:15:56.010 --> 00:16:01.810
I thought that an enlarged body
would allow a perfect ability to reside in it.

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:08.940
I'm missing something.
There's something I need to complete this body.

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:12.360
Guess I'll start trying different things out.

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:18.950
There's no sign of Antiskill.
Did we drive them back?

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:24.080
You can thank this monster for that.
Hishigata's weapon is pretty handy.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:27.170
All right, let's regroup now,
while we have the chance.

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:28.460
Let's go!

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:29.590
Wha--?!

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:35.970
Why...?

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:38.310
We're on your side!

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:51.240
O-Oh... I can tell, I can tell! My evolution!
My evolution is accelerating!

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:54.320
This is what I was missing!

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:57.240
If I assimilate all of them...

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:09.710
O-Our... Our j-justice is--

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:32.940
What the hell?! Why is it
suddenly attacking?! Is it hungry?!

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:37.070
HQ, HQ, this is Alpha. We have
five DA in custody and are heading to--

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:40.620
Aw, damn, we're engaging unidentified creatures!

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:44.080
Send backup--

00:17:54.970 --> 00:17:57.050
H-Help us...!

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:59.140
Come on! Quick!

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:09.270
Let's go!

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:11.570
Hold it! We still don't have clearance!

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:17.950
I'm going anyway. I'm going to go help them.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:18.990
Yomikawa...

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:21.830
I'm a teacher before I'm Antiskill.

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:26.330
Abandoning people asking for help
is not something I teach my students!

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.920
She's got us there.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:30.830
H-Hey!

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:41.850
Hurry and get out of there!

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:43.680
B-But you're...

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:46.520
Now isn't the time to be going at each other.

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:00.030
Yomikawa!

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:02.740
Ito, behind you!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:09.870
Well, we haven't been
ordered not to save lives, either.

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:12.380
Let's start doing our jobs as teachers.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:14.550
Yeah, you got it!

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:35.360
Tch, there's no end to them. Huh?

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:56.210
The corpses are moving around.
Are these pseudo-souls?

00:19:56.210 --> 00:20:01.090
No, something else.
They have neither life nor pseudo-souls.

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:02.890
But even so, they're moving.

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:05.720
It's a work only a god could perform.

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:09.730
Has that thing really become a so-called god?

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:12.560
Tch.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:36.040
It's no use. These people are...

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:38.250
Look away.

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:45.800
These guys are already dead, remember?

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:49.140
So what are here are nothing but corpses.

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:50.100
Master...

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:55.560
This is not what a hero does.
This is a job for a son-of-a-bitch villain.

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:05.360
Imagine, hearing the word "hero"
coming from a villain like you...

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:08.740
It's almost like you know a bona fide hero...

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:12.620
Tch, stop bringing up worthless memories.

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:20.420
Don't get in too deep!
Engage them from a distance!

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:21.630
Right!

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:26.090
Amazing! Outstanding!

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:32.520
This is the ultimate evolution!
This truly is the Rosenthal's 400-year wish!

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:35.730
At last, I will become a god!

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:41.570
What a hassle. No matter how many
of them we defeat, they keep popping up.

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:44.240
Haven't we gotten to
this thing's main body yet?

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:47.200
I'm reading it close by. But...

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:52.120
The body is getting even larger
and has acquired new powers...

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:57.500
This thing's evolution is accelerating...
There's no more time, mm-hmm...

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:02.500
Tch, I'm just about out of time, too.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:37.010
"Next time"

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:41.570
"Something to Protect"
